      "review_description": "From our first contact, John was keen to share his knowledge of solar panels and very soon created the most environmentally and cost-efficient solution for our new home. John and team arrived earlier than the scheduled time (!! So efficient!) and worked for two long days straight, around our removalists - and in the rain!We have found John and team to be very friendly, helpful, understanding, polite, clean and so positive! We are happy to recommend John and his team as our favoured option for solar panel insights and installation, in the area - Well done, and big thanks, to John and team from Sunset Solar!! ??????Warmly,Stephen, Jennifer, Rebekah and Aysia",
