      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "John and his team were a pleasure to deal with from the initial enquiry through installation and commissioning our new 10.5kw solar system. John responded to our initial enquiry personally, came out to view the job onsite and discussed and explained the various options before providing their proposal. Once we accepted the proposal his team installed the system quickly, were polite, efficient and professional and left the job site spotless. John then returned to commission the system and the power meter and explained how the system worked and answered our questions. The system is operating exactly as proposed and we would not hesitate to recommend John and his team at Sunset Solar. First class!",
