      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "John was professional and helpful. I compared like for like panels and inverters and his quote was cheaper. The only complaint I would have is that he told me he would install the inverter in my garage for no extra cost. This was not written in the quote and when it came time for installation he didn’t want to do it. I am not too happy with the inverter being on a west facing wall with only an aluminium cover over half of it.  The cover is actually very dangerous and I am looking into how to make it safer. Anyone could walk into the very sharp corners where it is installed. The connection was all fine. Just waiting for a first bill now!",
